// Project-wide Xcode build settings for DNP Remote Mac. Anything
// that should be the same for every contributor goes here. Anything
// personal — most importantly your Apple Developer `DEVELOPMENT_TEAM`
// — goes in the gitignored `Local.xcconfig` next to this file
// (template at `Local.sample.xcconfig`).
//
// The `?` in `#include?` makes the include optional, so `xcodegen`
// + `xcodebuild` keep working on a fresh checkout that hasn't
// created a `Local.xcconfig` yet. Without a team in place, you
// won't be able to *sign* the app, but the project will still
// generate and compile.

#include? "Local.xcconfig"
